<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96743" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στηριγ-μός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>being fixed, standing still</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν πλανήτων ἀστέρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					1.81
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gem.
				1.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.76d
			</span></i>, Theo Sm.<i><span class="en">
				p.148
			</span></i> H., <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				34.28
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPar.</u>
				19
			</span></i>
			<i>bis</i><i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				13
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Al.
				<u>G.</u>
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Theol.Ar.</u>
				15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				8(4).241
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>fixedness</i>, of steady light, opp. flashing, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mu.</u>
				395b7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκπεσεῖν τοῦ ἰδίου ς</span>. from
			your proper <i>firmness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>2 Ep.Pet.</u>
				3.17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> Rhet.,
				<i>sustaining</i> of the voice on certain words or syllables,
			so as to give them force, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ μακραὶ συλλαβαί, στηριγμούς τινας
					ἔχουσαι καὶ ἐγκαθίσματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Comp.</u>
					20
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στηριγμοὺς ἔχειν πρὸς ἄλληλα τὰ
				ὀνόματα</span> mutual <i>support, buttressing</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				40.4
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιστηριγμός</span>.</div>
